---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About Prodory | AO Plus Solutions" description="Prodory is the cloud-native and platform engineering practice of AO Plus Solutions Pvt Ltd, established 2019 in Mumbai." path="/about/">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-muted"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</nav>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About Prodory</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted">
      Prodory is the enterprise cloud-native and platform engineering practice of {SITE.parent}, established in {SITE.founded} and based in {SITE.location}.
      The company is registered with DPIIT Startup India and UDYAM (UDYAM-MH-33-0401680).
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line p-5"><h2 class="font-semibold">How we work</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">We start from the process and the platform, not the tool. We state what we will and will not do, in writing.</p></div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line p-5"><h2 class="font-semibold">What you keep</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Your repositories, runbooks and accounts. We do not hold your platform hostage.</p></div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line p-5"><h2 class="font-semibold">Open source first</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Kubernetes, OpenShift, Terraform, Ansible, Cilium and Podman. Our designs carry no proprietary lock-in.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Leadership and team</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Named profiles are published once each person has confirmed theirs. For introductions before then, write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will connect you with the right engineer.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
